  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can meditate to gain a blade skill.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extra Blade Skill.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Each day, you can take 1 hour of meditation to decide how to focus your mythic energies. At the end of this time, select 1 blade skill for which you meet all the prerequisites. You retain this blade skill until you next meditate on your mythic blade skill.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
